  "releaseNotes": "1.0.5 — Fixed NuGet dependency version format to [1.2024.9.69, ) minimum-version range; updated nuspec to 2013 schema; DLL target net472\n1.0.4 — Fixed DLL target path to lib\\net452\\Plugins per official XrmToolBox wiki\n1.0.3 — Fixed NuGet dependency ID to XrmToolBox for xrmtoolbox.com store compatibility\n1.0.2 — Flattened NuGet dependency format for store validator compatibility\n1.0.1 — Added 128x128 icon; fixed license expression and readme in package\n1.0.0 — Initial release: Dashboard, Agent Inventory, Security Scanner, Deployment Readiness, ALM Diff",
